    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Ahasia owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamenywa ba Yerusalemu bamiisia Ahasia omwana owa Yehoramu omutua, mu bweyaangu bwa paapa wewe. Sipupu sie babaandu babeecha ne Baarabu mu kambi, sieera babaana bakhulu ba Yehoramu boosi. Nio Ahasia okhwa Yehoramu, omwami owa Yuda amiia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasia aarakikha khukhwamiia ne ali ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kane ne kibili. Amiia khukhwama Yerusalemu kumwiiko mulala. Lisina lia maawe liaba bali Atalia. Atalia aba omwichukhulu owa Omri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasia akhola kamamayaanu nga enju eya Ahabu, sikila maawe aaba omukaambisi wewe mu khukhola kamamayaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhola kaali kamamayaanu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nga enju eya Ahabu ne yakhola. Akhola ario sikila enyuma we lifwa lia raraawe, balala khu be nju eya Ahabu baba bakaambisi bewe. Likaambila liabwe liakwisia Ahasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khuloonda khu likaambila liabwe, acha ne Yoramu okhwa Ahabu, omwami owa Isiraeli, khukhwibwaakala omwami Hasaeli owa Shamu a Ramoti-kileati. Bashamu baumisia Yoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoramu aakobola khucha khumenya aone mu lukoba lwa Yesireeli, kamakoonjo niko anyoola e Rama. Akanyoola nga apana ne omwami Hasaeli owa Shamu. Ne Ahasia omwami owa Yuda okhwa Yehoramu acha khubona Yoramu okhwa Ahabu mu Yesireeli sikila aba omulwale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Wele aaba akhalake ali, likwa lia Ahasia lienyekhana liiche mu khucha khubona Yoramu khuno. Sikila nga oola e Yesireeli, arura ne Yoramu khukhwakaanana ne Yehu okhwa Nimisi. Yehu aba niye Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi arobora khubunia enju eya Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Yehu ne aba ne alikho aana kumunaanio khunju eya Ahabu, anyoola babemeelesi ba Yuda ne babaana ba wandaaye ba Ahasia, mala abeera. Babaandu bano bakholelanga Ahasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ayiima Ahasia. Babaandu bewe banyoola Ahasia ne ekisile mu Samaria mala bamutiila. Areerwa khu Yehu mala Yehu amwiira. Bamusiikha sikila baloma bali, “Ali omwichukhulu owa Yehoshafati. Yehoshafati aria Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne kumwoyo kwewe kwoosi.” Ne nju eya Ahasia se yaba, ne omundu onyala khukhwamiia bubwami tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwini Atalia owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Atalia maayi owa Ahasia nga ne aabona ali omwana wewe afwiile, acha abunia enju yoosi eye bubwami eya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Yeosiabeati, omukhaana wo mwami abukula Yoashi okhwa Ahasia mala amukisa khukhwama khu basoleeli bo mwami ba baba siimbi khukhwirwa. Ara Yoashi no mulesi wewe mu lusiro lwe khukonamo. Mu ngila yino, Yehoshabeati, omukhaana owo mwami ne omukhasi owo omusaayi Yehoyata, (omukhasi yuno aba omukooko owa Ahasia) bakisa Yoashi khukhwama khu Atalia. Atalia se amwiira tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi aarama ne nabo khu miiko sita munju eya Wele nga Atalia ne aaba ne amiia sibala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
